### Usage rules

- **Background/base canvas:** `bg-surface` (`#161310`)
- **Elevated structural elements** (cards, nav bars, sidebar): `bg-surface-container` (`#221D18` equivalent)
- **Interactive/hover states, modal overlays:** `bg-surface-container-high` (`#2E2822`)
- **Primary CTAs and key branding moments:** `bg-primary` / `text-on-primary`
- **Secondary, lower-priority interactive elements:** `secondary` tones
- **Primary readable text:** `text-on-surface` (cream, `#F2ECE3`-equivalent) — never plain white
- **Secondary/metadata/disabled text:** `text-on-surface-variant` (muted gray-tan)
- **All card/container borders:** `border-outline-variant` (`#3A332B`-equivalent)

