## 2. Typography

Font: **Manrope** (import via Google Fonts or bundle locally — do not substitute).

```js
// tailwind.config.js
fontFamily: {
  sans: ['Manrope', 'sans-serif'],
}
```

| Token                | Size | Weight | Line height | Letter spacing | Use                            |
| -------------------- | ---- | ------ | ----------- | -------------- | ------------------------------ |
| `display-lg`         | 64px | 700    | 1.1         | -0.04em        | Hero headings                  |
| `display-md`         | 48px | 600    | 1.2         | -0.03em        | Section headings               |
| `headline-lg`        | 32px | 600    | 1.3         | -0.02em        | Page/card titles               |
| `headline-lg-mobile` | 28px | 600    | 1.3         | -0.01em        | Mobile page titles             |
| `body-lg`            | 18px | 400    | 1.6         | 0              | Lead paragraphs                |
| `body-md`            | 16px | 400    | 1.6         | 0              | Standard body text             |
| `label-lg`           | 14px | 600    | 1.4         | 0.05em         | Buttons, form labels           |
| `label-md`           | 12px | 500    | 1.4         | 0.02em         | Chips, metadata, table headers |

- Display/headline weights lean SemiBold–Bold with tight tracking for editorial impact
- Body text keeps generous 1.6 line-height for "air" against the dark palette
- **Labels and small buttons/table headers are uppercase** with increased letter-spacing — architectural, precise

